"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124238","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124238","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124238.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124238.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nUser provided Gamecontroller mapping via SDL_GAMECONTROLLERCONFIG may contain a `,crc:` field.\r\nThis makes the current parsing logic rejecting the mapping entry, if and only if the CRC does not start with an a or b (as the crc: is assumed to be a button function label).\r\n\r\nThe second change is just a typo in the error message.\r\n\r\n## Additional Info\r\n\r\nAlso reproducable with the 3.6.x branch, I did not check the 2.x and 1.x branches.\r\nIt does not happen with the community driven GamecontrollerDB, as it does not contain that CRC field by design.\r\nI came across this as I tried to utilize [Arcade DT](https://github.com/gemba/arcade-dt) with Godot. There you can also find sample mappings.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124238/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124238/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}